  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Street kid turned bone-dry wasteland wanderer, Cipher scavenged enough DRIP to trick out his flippers and learn the ways of the controller. Now he roams Subchain City, a silent ghost in the ruins, seeking the next big score for his flock.",
